msgstr "Ọkpọkọ Syslog agbakeela."

#: includes/functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Partition layout for %s is invalid or incomplete; partition maintenance stopped. Verify the partition metadata with SHOW CREATE TABLE and, if required, rebuild the partitions; writes continue into the dMaxValue safety partition."
msgstr "Nhazi nkewa maka %s ezughị ezu ma ọ bụ adịghị mma; akwụsịla nlekọta nkewa. Jiri SHOW CREATE TABLE nyochaa metadata nkewa ma, ọ bụrụ na ọ dị mkpa, wughachi nkewa ndị ahụ; ide ihe na-aga n'ihu na nkewa nchekwa dMaxValue."

