msgstr "Ndepụta Ọkwa Ahụike Pipeline"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Select an existing Thold notification list for pipeline health alerts. Enabled list recipients are combined with the email addresses below, preserving BCC recipients. Lists require the Thold notification-list table."
msgstr "Họrọ ndepụta ọkwa Thold dị adị maka mkpu ahụike pipeline. A na-ejikọta ndị nnata nke ndepụta gbanyere na adreesị Ozi-e dị n'okpuru, na-echekwa ndị nnata BCC. Ndepụta chọrọ tebụl ndepụta-ọkwa Thold."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Email Recipients"
msgstr "Ndị Nnata Ozi-e Ahụike Pipeline"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Comma-separated email recipients for pipeline failures and recovery. Leave blank and select no notification list to disable email; health remains visible on the Status tab and state changes are logged. Checks require the Cacti poller to run."
msgstr "Ndị nnata ozi-e e ji kọma kewaa maka ọdịda na mgbake pipeline. Hapụ oghere ma ahọrọla ndepụta ozi ọkwa ọ bụla iji gbanyụọ ozi-e; ahụike na-anọgide na-ahụ anya na taabụ Ọnọdụ ma a na-edekọ mgbanwe ọnọdụ. Nyocha chọrọ ka Poller Cacti gbaa ọsọ."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Reminder Interval"
msgstr "Oge Ncheta Ahụike Pipeline"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Repeat notifications for ongoing pipeline problems after this interval. Failed email attempts are retried no more than once every five minutes."
msgstr "Kwugharịa ọkwa maka nsogbu pipeline na-aga n'ihu mgbe oge etiti a gachara. A na-anwalegharị mgbalị ozi-e dara ada ọ naghị akarị otu ugboro kwa nkeji ise."

