msgid "Recovery Pause Between Batches"
msgstr "Nkwụsịtụ Ngbake N'etiti Otu"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pause between each 100-record Main Collector delivery transaction. A longer pause lowers Main Collector pressure; a shorter pause speeds backlog convergence."
msgstr "Nkwụsịtụ n'etiti azụmahịa nnyefe Main Collector nke ndekọ 100 ọ bụla. Nkwụsịtụ dị ogologo na-ebelata nrụgide Main Collector; nkwụsịtụ dị mkpụmkpụ na-eme ka nkwakọba ọrụ gaa ngwa ngwa."

