#: syslog_alerts.php
msgid "Optional command to run when this threshold recovers after its quiet period. Uses the same replacement variables as Alert command. SYSLOG_EVENT is clear; SYSLOG_BREACH_ID matches the breach command. Failed commands are retried. Leave blank to disable."
msgstr "Iwu nhọrọ a ga-agba mgbe ọnụ ụzọ a gbakere mgbe oge jụụ ya gasịrị. Na-eji otu mgbanwe nnọchi dịka iwu Mkpu. SYSLOG_EVENT doro anya; SYSLOG_BREACH_ID dakọtara na iwu mmebi. A na-anwalegharị iwu ndị dara ada. Hapụ ya n'efu iji gbanyụọ."

